      "content": "Wait, sorry, can we redo that? I actually need this to be strictly professional. We're a global tech firm, so the tone needs to be very high-level and corporate—no \"goblin\" references or jokes. Could you just provide a clean, formal outline focused on monitor height, wrist positioning, and desk setup without any of that extra stuff? Thanks.",
